    "title": "Friday Tree Giveaway and Hub & Soul Concert Canceled Due to Weather - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Johnnie Adcox ,\n1 days ago Lincoln Parks and Recreation has canceled Friday evening’s free tree giveaway at Union Plaza because of inclement weather. The Hub & Soul concert scheduled for the amphitheater has also been canceled. The city had planned to distribute 200 trees beginning at 5:30 p.m. Parks Operations Coordinator Mike Comstock said... Read full article",
